# The PSY-Q-era toolchain cannot cope with CRLF: GCC 2.7.2's cpp sees a
# backslash followed by CR (not LF) and fails to join macro continuation
# lines, so include_asm.h's INCLUDE_ASM macro collapses into "stray '\' in
# program" errors for the whole translation unit. Force LF everywhere on
# checkout, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.bundle binary
